ute and girly!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Whitethorn Games</h2>We\u2019re an indie game publisher focusing on pleasant, cozy games that can be played in pieces, that require no special skills or knowledge, and that anyone can pick up and play. We\u2019re believers in accessibility, inclusion, and widening the audience that gets to play. We like to consider ourselves the defenders of easy games.",
